[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:17.12]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night
[00:22.74]left a single note and went on their way
[00:27.48]I never got their name until the credits
[00:31.76]now it plays here every single day
[00:37.50]I was painting a picture (@nishal21)
[00:40.66]One note at a time
[00:48.48]from people passing through
[00:54.42]a name beside a line
[00:58.06]and part of it is you
[01:03.06]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer
